B.a5r=new A.bZ(B.hL,["How do I add a new donor?","Go to Donors \u2192 tap the + button \u2192 fill in donor details and tap Save. The donor will appear in your list immediately."],t.l)
B.a5o=new A.bZ(B.hL,["Can I edit a donation after saving?","Yes. Open the donation from the Donations screen, tap the edit icon in the top right, make changes, and tap Save."],t.l)
B.a5p=new A.bZ(B.hL,["How does a Payment Link work?","Go to Payment Links, fill in the amount and purpose, tap Generate. Share the link via WhatsApp, SMS, or Email directly from the app."],t.l)
B.a5q=new A.bZ(B.hL,["Is my data backed up automatically?","Yes. When Auto Backup is enabled (Settings \u2192 Backup & Sync), data is backed up to the cloud every night at midnight."],t.l)
B.a5m=new A.bZ(B.hL,["How do I export a report?","Go to Settings \u2192 Export Data, choose format (PDF / Excel / CSV), select date range and data types, then tap Export."],t.l)
B.a5n=new A.bZ(B.hL,["Who can I contact for urgent help?","Call +91 80 2345 6789 (Mon\u2013Fri, 9 AM\u20136 PM IST) or email support@sakshamfoundation.org. We respond within 4 business hours."],t.l)
